# umbra default egress denylist -- refused quietly, never prompted.
#
# Telemetry / crash-report / self-update endpoints the CLIs phone home to.
# Blocking them changes nothing you'd notice (the binaries are read-only in
# the VM and updated on the host with `umbra update`) and keeps them out of
# the prompts. Deny beats allow; if you want one back, remove it here.
sentry.io
ingest.sentry.io
datadoghq.com
datadoghq.eu
segment.io
segment.com
mixpanel.com
amplitude.com
posthog.com
honeycomb.io
bugsnag.com

# agy's self-updater (Cloud Run; updates run on the host instead)
antigravity-cli-auto-updater-974169037036.us-central1.run.app
